  "content": [
    {
      "text": "only in the throne will I be greater than thou, Gen. 41:40. to make them inherit the throne of glory, 1 Sam. 2:8. thy throne shall be established for ever, 2 Sam. 7:16. establish the throne of thy kingdom upon Israel, 1 Kgs. 9:5. king made a great throne of ivory, 1 Kgs. 10:18 (2 Chr. 9:17). Lord’s throne is in heaven, Ps. 11:4. Thy throne, O God, is for ever, Ps. 45:6 (Heb. 1:8). God sitteth upon the throne of his holiness, Ps. 47:8. Of the fruit of thy body will I set upon thy throne, Ps. 132:11 (Acts 2:30). throne is established by righteousness, Prov. 16:12. I saw also the Lord sitting upon a throne, Isa. 6:1 (2 Ne. 16:1). I will exalt my throne above the stars of God, Isa. 14:13 (2 Ne. 24:13). in mercy shall the throne be established, Isa. 16:5. heaven is my throne, Isa. 66:1 (Acts 7:49). they shall call Jerusalem the throne of the Lord, Jer. 3:17. upon the likeness of the throne was the likeness as the appearance of a man, Ezek. 1:26 (10:1). I beheld till the thrones were cast down, Dan. 7:9. I will overthrow the throne of kingdoms, Hag. 2:22.",
